sequenceDiagram
    participant browser
    participant server

    rect rgba(165,214,167,0.15)
    %% --- Initial page load ---
    browser->>server: GET https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/spa
    activate server
    server-->>browser: HTML document (SPA shell)
    deactivate server

    browser->>server: GET https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/main.css
    activate server
    server-->>browser: CSS file
    deactivate server

    browser->>server: GET https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/main.js
    activate server
    server-->>browser: JavaScript file
    deactivate server
    end

    Note right of browser: Browser executes SPA JS and fetches existing notes dynamically
    browser->>server: GET https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/data.json
    activate server
    server-->>browser: [{ "content": "HTML is easy", "date": "2023-1-1" }, ...]
    deactivate server
    Note right of browser: Browser renders the notes in the SPA view

    rect rgba(206,147,216,0.18)
    %% --- Creating a new note in SPA ---
    Note left of browser: User types a new note in the SPA text field
    browser->>browser: Prepare new note JSON
    Note right of browser: e.g., { "content": "Learn SPA behavior", "date": "2026-02-16" }

    browser->>server: POST https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/notes
    activate server
    Note right of server: Server saves the new note
    server-->>browser: { "id": 125, "content": "Learn SPA behavior", "date": "2026-02-16" }
    deactivate server

    Note right of browser: Browser dynamically updates the SPA view to include the new note
    end